  "goodToKnow": "Unwahr means untrue or false: eine unwahre Behauptung. It's more formal than falsch and common in law: unwahre Tatsachenbehauptungen (false statements of fact) are not protected as free opinion and can be prohibited. Die Unwahrheit sagen is a polite way to say lügen. Don't confuse it with unwahrscheinlich (unlikely)."
